<title>USA: Fla. Board of Regents to sell $37 mln on Thursday.</title>
<headline>Fla. Board of Regents to sell $37 mln on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Florida Board of Regents plans to sell $36.8 million university system improvement revenue bonds in a competitive sale Thursday at 1030 EDT.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
